    "are the imported-goods requirements effectively non-binding (i.e., they don't constrain production at all and only matter if we later compute the cost of imports), or is there a hidden constraint I should be aware of that limits total imported goods?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy clarification regarding whether the imported goods requirements are non-binding or subject to a hidden limit."
